  "title": "A Number-One Egg Bread",
  "description": "Egg bread is delicious on its own, but this slightly sweet Hawaiian concoction is sublime when used for French toast, bread pudding, or fondue.",
  "authors": [
    "Kevin Ryan"
  ],
  "date_published": "1998-08-25T09:19:56-04:00",
  "date_modified": "2025-12-22T15:02:44-05:00",
  "prep_time": "PT25M",
  "cook_time": "PT40M",
  "total_time": "PT205M",
  "yield": [
    "18",
    "1 braided loaf"
  ],
  "categories": [
    "Bread"
  ],
  "cuisines": [
    "Hawaiian"
  ],
  "regions": [
    "Hawaiian"
  ],
  "breadcrumbs": [],
  "keywords": [],
  "ingredients": [
    "2 (.25 ounce) packages active dry yeast",
    "0.66666698455811 cup warm water (110 degrees F/45 degrees C)",
    "6 large egg yolks",
    "4 large eggs, at room temperature, divided",
    "0.5 cup vegetable oil",
    "0.25 cup white sugar",
    "1 teaspoon salt",
    "4.5 cups all-purpose flour, divided",
    "1 pinch salt"
  ],
  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "Gather all ingredients.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/5YL3YgnaQIZcqg07qnVPmx5TdlY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-01-3d388b318bbe48a093ce71b56a4a97ed.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_01.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Dissolve yeast in warm water in a large bowl. Let stand until yeast softens and begins to form a creamy foam, about 5 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/4YD-jQHB4NprqY7_9HBRi76dsNA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-02-2f4f1db3bb724e0599c601818974c3c6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_02.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Stir in egg yolks, 3 whole eggs, oil, sugar, and salt. Mix in 3 ½ cups of flour to make a sticky dough.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/xltgR-cRymbd021-ngc3l2SMQ6s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-04-6da029d1b4f24e8f971fa73d48929957.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_03.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Turn dough out onto a lightly floured surface. Knead with remaining 1 cup flour until smooth and elastic, about 7 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/sUW5G5ghX8R9lxIDvshtWkSAHlA=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-05-7cb5fcbe5d2244edb56fbc7d8910a942.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_04.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer dough to a well-oiled bowl and turn until entire surface is coated with oil.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/dqrS5vXseE74QrXagJeHkdIzXUQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-06-81562d7f184a473f9d1033ae7a47c481.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_05.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cover dough with a damp cloth and let rise in a warm place until doubled in volume, about 1 ½ hours.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/8cbIoYw_eHOnDPDJHzq2UGWEmyw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-07-d00a3b3b12644c579633b3a6fcf863b6.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_06.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Punch down the dough and divide into thirds. Roll each piece of dough into a 12-inch long rope.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/yv_aL-XMBTdXjJtoJZ5oNxgivsc=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-09-19afa6ed01fc43f597d43ca5a2c90379.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_07.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Braid the three strands together and seal the ends.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/w8vxwrHFYSUSUTG4Kb_N0puMbVw=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-10-259f091331144348af10fb75f6e02d1c.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_08.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Transfer dough to a greased cookie sheet. Whisk remaining egg with a pinch of salt; brush on top and sides of bread. Set egg wash aside.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/NNG53bhKzbVWziAiowGH-zDpd7s=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-11-2748b46d48344eea8560b337f90846b1.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_09.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Let dough rise until doubled in volume, about 45 minutes.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/aOuVJITeCbMMkk4LPnEDLmmotuY=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-12-83feaf6b9c304810b5191f1a79d0b3ce.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_10.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Preheat the oven to 375 degrees F (190 degrees C). Brush bread again with egg wash.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/zR70Z7D4TDCei7mjoMapG-zilQQ=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-13-f141ce2cf60240eb840cfa1386f1d525.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_11.webp"
    },
    {
      "text": "Bake bread in the preheated oven until golden, about 40 minutes. Cool on a wire rack.",
      "section": null,
      "name": null,
      "url": null,
      "image_sources": [
        "https://www.allrecipes.com/thmb/6URS4dQLoEqXJCuBD7bAtTnF040=/1500x0/filters:no_upscale():max_bytes(150000):strip_icc()/AR-6879-A-Number-One-Egg-Bread-gw-ddmfs-4x3-step-15-0fa084b434484c6089a112ac834e7d7f.jpg"
      ],
      "image": "assets/images/6879/step_12.webp"
    }
  ],
